  "body": "Viewing by appointment - Please contact Ben \r\n\r\nOpportunities on streets like this are few and far between.\r\n\r\nTightly held and quietly prestigious, this is one of Devonport's most desirable addresses, a location where homes are cherished, neighbours stay for decades, and offerings like this are rarely seen!\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned behind an impressive stone wall and secure gates, the home delivers an immediate sense of presence. Beyond, a beautifully maintained residence unfolds. Constructed with solid brick and weatherboard, meticulously cared for over many years, and presented with a level of pride that is increasingly rare.\r\n\r\nSet on a beautiful, flat freehold site, the property offers effortless living with low-maintenance grounds, an abundance of fruit trees, and exceptional practicality. There is ample space for multiple vehicles, including the boat. Along with extensive storage options and multiple sheds for tools, hobbies, or weekend projects.\r\n\r\nThe outlook captures an incredible view toward Mt Victoria, while neighbouring Mt Cambria provides a stunning natural extension to your backyard, perfect for walking, exploring, and enjoying the lifestyle that makes Devonport so special.\r\n\r\nThe home itself is honest, warm, and immediately liveable, a place that has been deeply enjoyed and thoughtfully loved. At the same time, there is clear scope to further enhance and add value over time, making this as much a future opportunity as it is a present-day sanctuary.\r\n\r\nThe location speaks for itself! Moments to Cheltenham Beach and Torpedo Bay, an easy walk into Devonport village, and zoning for highly regarded schools, including Belmont Intermediate and Takapuna Grammar.\r\n\r\nQuiet, secure, and surrounded by quality homes, this property offers more than just a place to live but a lifestyle.\r\n\r\nTo download property files please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/QE7F",
